repository-code: "https://github.com/poli0981/proton-sieve-filters"
abstract: >-
  A generated set of Sieve filters that sort a Proton Mail inbox into folders,
  built from a typed dataset of email sender domains and subject keywords across
  22 categories, with validation tooling for Proton's Sieve dialect.
